WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:04.690
What happens to a kilogram of white wax&nbsp;
when it is placed into the Clockworks?

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:09.610
Assistant Researcher Erickson placed&nbsp;
one kilogram of white wax into SCP-914&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:13.150
on the setting "Very Fine." The&nbsp;
output produced was an animate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:17.710
wax figure in the shape of Dr. Beiderman.&nbsp;
The figure was destroyed by site security.

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:21.970
Site security was then reprimanded&nbsp;
for unauthorized destruction of a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:24.250
possibly sentient anomalous artifact.

